%% code-consigliere
%% Summary: Resolve a target project, preserve private evidence, investigate together, hand off an agreed seed, and verify the returned build.
%% Sources: skills/code-consigliere/core.md
%% Not shown: helper discovery, record schemas, evidence methods, indirect usage checks, privacy review, and host permission limits
%% Alt: A target enters private setup and workflow discovery, then discussion and signoff before a seed or explicitly agreed implementation; a returned build is verified and knowledge revised.

flowchart TD
    A[Resolve target and project rules] --> B{Target unambiguous?}
    B -- No --> C[Ask which project]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D{Collection available and enabled?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Equip and recover private records]
    D -- No --> F[Disclose limited persistence]
    E --> G[Init: inventory and select workflow]
    F --> G
    G --> H[Discuss reality and recorded rationale]
    H --> I{Change agreed within boundaries?}
    I -- No --> J[Preserve findings and discuss next step]
    I -- Yes --> K[Record signoff and acceptance checks]
    K --> L[Write safe seed or expressly agreed change]
    L --> M[Return after project build]
    M --> N[Verify downstream code tests and docs]
    N --> O{Agreement satisfied?}
    O -- No --> H
    O -- Yes --> P[Revise private wiki and terminology]
